Subject: [PATCH] rfc3195: declare the existing Unix-domain socket initializer

Retain the existing package's GCC 14 declaration repair as a reviewable
source patch. The prototype exactly matches socketsUnix.c and exposes it to
beeplisten.c without changing either implementation or any test. Preserve
the released header's CRLF line endings.

